            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/TCFT"} TCFT
            %a{:href => "#http://nlab.mathforge.org/nlab/show/TCFT#ActionFunctionals"} TCFT – Effective background theories
            for more on this.
          %p Discussion of an alternative derivation of this statement is in
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jan+de+Boer"}> Jan de Boer
              , Paul de Medeiros, Sheer El-Showk, Annamaria Sinkovics,
              %em
                Open
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
