                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} G_2
                Strings
              (
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0611080"}> arXiv:hep-th/0611080
              )
          %p A textbook account of this relation is in
          %ul
            %li
              Marcos Mariño,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Chern-Simons Theory, Matrix Models, and Topological Strings
